# Task Closure

Use this owner only when more than one changing procedure shares completion, or
when a delayed AAR, knowledge, integrity, or external-delivery phase has real
evidence of independent use.

## Completion Gate

1. Re-state the frozen outcome and the exact deliverables bound to this task.
2. Run the fitted, fresh validation set and record failures honestly.
3. Perform the short AAR/integrity scan required by the materialized owners.
4. Verify the requested terminal artifact itself; readiness or an intermediate
   command is not the terminal state.

If any gate is unverified, return to the selected procedure with the affected
path paused. Do not broaden scope merely because a neighboring task is open.
